# Superpowers workflow

Before non-trivial feature work, read root [`AGENTS.md`](AGENTS.md) and [`docs/README.md`](docs/README.md). Do not duplicate those docs here.

## Hard gate

- New features or behavior changes: brainstorm → write `docs/superpowers/specs/YYYY-MM-DD-*-design.md` → user approves → write `docs/superpowers/plans/YYYY-MM-DD-*.md` → only then change product code.
- Do not invent process docs under `docs/community/` or `docs/releases/`.
- Before editing a module, read its `src/components/*/README.md` (FR rules). Update that README when behavior changes.
- Small fixes (typo, test green, clear bugfix) may skip a full spec; keep changes verifiable.

## Product invariants (summary)

Local-first, narrow IPC, forward Migrations, no stock tips / auto-trading / credential commits. Full list in `AGENTS.md` and `CONTRIBUTING.md`.
